---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import jsonLd from "../data/jsonld/experience.json";
---

<Base
  title="Experience — Chad Keith | Career Timeline &amp; Notable Deployments"
  description="Chad Keith's career: president of Atlas Technology Solutions, Director of Operations at The PC & MacHelp Centers, and Apple device deployments for universities, banks, healthcare systems, and school districts across the Southeast."
  path="/experience.html"
  ogType="website"
  image="/images/chad-keith.jpg"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="page-hero">
    <h1>Experience</h1>
    <p>Two decades in technology — from computer engineering and operations management to founding an Apple consultancy.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Career</div>
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <div class="timeline">

      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="period">2018 — Present</div>
        <h3>President &amp; Founder</h3>
        <div class="org"><a href="https://atlascarolina.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Atlas Technology Solutions</a> · Davidson, NC</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Founded an Apple certified IT consultancy serving businesses in Charlotte and across the Carolinas</li>
          <li>Apple Consultants Network member; certified Jamf MSP, Integrator, and Services Partner</li>
          <li>Launched <a href="https://atlassolutions.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Atlas AI</a> — AI integrations, agentic workflows, training, and security consulting (MasterClass AI Fundamentals, Aug 2026)</li>
          <li>Apple deployments, mobile device management, Mac network support, and managed IT services for small and medium businesses</li>
          <li>Google Workspace administration and automation tooling — GAM scripts, audit bots, and internal dashboards</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="period">2016 — 2018</div>
        <h3>Director of Operations</h3>
        <div class="org">The PC &amp; MacHelp Centers · Charlotte, NC</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Converted a break/fix IT company into a full managed service provider — implementing CRM, remote monitoring and management, MDM, and network monitoring systems</li>
          <li>Took the company from negative profits to grossing nearly $2M annually for three consecutive years</li>
          <li>Grew the client base by nearly 200% while improving retention and setting new SLA standards</li>
          <li>Directed an overhaul of company financial systems, ticketing, and service processes</li>
          <li>Served as virtual CIO for a variety of clients and managed all internal and client projects in Charlotte</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="period">2012 — 2016</div>
        <h3>Systems Engineer</h3>
        <div class="org">The PC &amp; MacHelp Centers · Charlotte, NC</div>
        <ul>
          <li>IT consulting across macOS, iOS, and PC systems for clients throughout the Southeast</li>
          <li>Completed the Jamf Integrator program; designed and ran MDM deployments covering over ten thousand endpoints across education, banking, architecture, and marketing</li>
          <li>Designed network infrastructure — routing, switching, and wireless deployments</li>
          <li>Data center build-out: storage, virtualization, and networking for the company's infrastructure</li>
          <li>Migrated hundreds of locally hosted mailboxes and file shares to Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, Box, and Dropbox</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="period">2008 — 2012</div>
        <h3>Technical Director / Instructor</h3>
        <div class="org">Masterworks School of the Arts · Mooresville, NC</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Consulted on computer software, hardware, and audio equipment; maintained systems and trained staff</li>
          <li>Taught music theory and instrumentation classes</li>
          <li>Implemented strategies for new areas of business growth</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="period">2006 — 2008</div>
        <h3>Regional Manager</h3>
        <div class="org">Rogers / Premier Unloading Service · Charlotte, NC</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Managed daily operations across seven buildings with over 300 employees</li>
          <li>Trained managers on the WSDM system; troubleshot data input and corrected code errors</li>
          <li>Created instructional documentation for supervisors and technicians</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Track Record</div>
    <h2>Organizations I've Supported</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Over my career I've implemented training, device rollouts, Jamf installations, and ongoing Apple device management for organizations including:</p>
    <div class="client-grid">
      <div class="client-item">Wake Forest University</div>
      <div class="client-item">UNC Chapel Hill</div>
      <div class="client-item">Western Carolina University</div>
      <div class="client-item">High Point University</div>
      <div class="client-item">Central Piedmont Community College</div>
      <div class="client-item">University of North Texas</div>
      <div class="client-item">Raymond James Bank</div>
      <div class="client-item">TIAA Bank</div>
      <div class="client-item">AXA Equitable</div>
      <div class="client-item">Belk Headquarters</div>
      <div class="client-item">Carolinas HealthCare</div>
      <div class="client-item">Henry County Schools</div>
      <div class="client-item">Orange County Government</div>
      <div class="client-item">Realtree</div>
      <div class="client-item">Raising Cane's</div>
      <div class="client-item">Skookum</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Depth</div>
    <h2>Representative Projects</h2>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Enterprise MDM at Scale</h3>
        <p>Created policies, configurations, and images for over ten thousand endpoints across education, banking, architecture, and marketing verticals.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">Jamf</span><span class="tag">Apple MDM</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Break/Fix to MSP Conversion</h3>
        <p>Implemented CRM, RMM, MDM, and network monitoring to fully convert an IT shop into a managed service company, with new SLA and audit standards.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">Operations</span><span class="tag">MSP</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Data Center Build-Out</h3>
        <p>Set up and configured data center infrastructure — storage, virtualization, networking, and routing — with fully redundant managed networks.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">VMware</span><span class="tag">Infrastructure</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Cloud Migrations</h3>
        <p>Migrated hundreds of locally hosted mailboxes and file shares to Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, Box, and Dropbox.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">M365</span><span class="tag">Google Workspace</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Network Infrastructure Design</h3>
        <p>Designed, planned, and managed network implementations — routing, switching, and wireless — using UniFi, Aerohive, Meraki, Cisco, Fortinet, and pfSense.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">Networking</span><span class="tag">Wireless</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <h3>Sales Engineering</h3>
        <p>Worked alongside clients and technical staff to scope effective, budget-conscious solutions; built processes that made the sales team more efficient.</p>
        <div class="project-footer"><span class="tag">Consulting</span><span class="tag">Process</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="cta-panel">
      <h2>Working with Apple fleets today</h2>
      <p>This experience now powers Atlas Technology Solutions — Apple certified consulting and managed IT for the Carolinas.</p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="/services.html" class="btn btn-primary">See Services</a>
        <a href="https://atlascarolina.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">Visit atlascarolina.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
